51degrees provides CMake targets:

  find_package(51Degrees CONFIG REQUIRED)
  # Device Detection in C or C++
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE 51Degrees::hash-c)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE 51Degrees::hash-cxx)
  # IP Intelligence in C or C++
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE 51Degrees::ip-intelligence-c)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE 51Degrees::ip-intelligence-cxx)

The data files are not included. The free Lite files are linked from
https://github.com/51Degrees/data
